# Code owners for Buiy. Review routing for GitHub's "Require review from Code
# Owners" branch-protection rule — enabled in tandem with the ruleset on `main`
# (see docs/plans/2026-06-21-ci-hardening.md). Until then this file is advisory.
#
# Single maintainer today; the explicit supply-chain / CI entries below exist so
# that those high-blast-radius files always surface to an owner even after more
# contributors join.

# Default owner for everything in the repo.
*                       @intendednull

# CI, build, and supply-chain configuration — changes here can alter what runs
# in every job or what dependencies/licenses are admitted.
/.github/               @intendednull
/deny.toml              @intendednull
/Cargo.toml             @intendednull
/Cargo.lock             @intendednull
/rust-toolchain.toml    @intendednull
/clippy.toml            @intendednull
/rustfmt.toml           @intendednull
